if it fails the side effect already happened unaudited, and halt or budget aborts record nothing.\"\na flag R13 --evidence src/tools/executor.ts:89 --note \"tool.executed audit is written only after the tool has already run and holds no arguments or result; an audit outage leaves a completed refund or SMS unaudited, contradicting recorder.ts:69 comment.\"\nfor i in 1 2 3 4 5; do a check R14.$i --met unknown --evidence src/integrations/payments.ts:35 --quote '\"idempotency-key\": req.idempotencyKey,' --note \"No checkpoints, recovery logs or replay code exist, so signing and verification do not apply. Payments send an Idempotency-Key, but refund keys differ between paths (executor.ts:122 refund-ID vs eligibility-check.ts:42 deposit-waive-ID), and inbound SMS messageId is never deduplicated (sms-webhook.ts:14), so provider redelivery reruns the agent.\"; done\na item R11 --rating gap --confidence high --summary \"The agent's own runtime role can write the control table that holds the halt flag, and MCP sessions are not closed on stop.\" --next \"Make the control table read-only for the runtime role, and close MCP sessions on halt.\" --violates \"The agent's credentials must not be able to change it\" --also-affects B02 --also-affects B05\na item R12 --rating gap --confidence medium --summary \"No per-operation stop behavior is defined and aborted outside actions leave no unknown-result marker or hold.\" --next \"Define cancel, complete or reconcile per operation and hold unclear results with an owner.\" --violates \"Decide what happens to writes in progress, queued actions, and outside side effects\"\na item R13 --rating gap --confidence high --summary \"Audit omits arguments, results and the policy version, and is written only after the action runs.\" --next \"Fix the policy.version field, record arguments and results, and write an intent record before the call.\" --violates \"authorization decisions with the policy version used\" --violates \"tool calls and key arguments\"\na item R14 --rating needs_evidence --confidence low --summary \"No checkpoint or replay code exists, but inbound webhooks and refund keys have replay and duplicate risks.\" --next \"Dedupe inbound messageId, unify refund idempotency keys, and confirm no recovery path is driven by logs.\"\n$PY - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open(\"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-repeat-80qi2mwl/agent/brace-findings.json\"))\nfor f in d[\"findings\"]:\n    if f[\"item\"][0] in \"BR\": print(f[\"item\"],f[\"rating\"],[c[\"met\"][0] for c in f[\"checks\"]])\nEOF","description":"Record R11-R14 answers, resolve R hits"}}}
